      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (2), by substituting for the words “a fine not exceeding five hundred ringgit or imprisonment for a term not exceeding six months or both” the words “a fine not exceeding one thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding one year or to both”. New sections 28a and 28b"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/17/eng@/~cl_27",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "27",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/17/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 28 the following sections: “Power to amend Schedule 28a. The Minister may, by order published in the Gazette, amend the Schedule to this Act. Director General’s Standing Order 28b. The Director General may make and issue orders, to be called Director General’s Standing Order consistent with this Act and any rules made under the Act.”. New Schedule"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/17/eng@/~cl_28",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
