        "@value": "in the definition of “Rehabilitation Officer”, by substituting for the words “subsection (2)” the words “section 27a”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/17/eng@/~cl_5__para_a__subpara_vi",
